  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ANCP is a unique Australian aid program. It is a partnership between the Australian Government and accredited Australian NGOs. For 50 years, this partnership has contributed to sustainable economic growth and poverty reduction in some of the world&apos;s poorest countries. The ANCP is the Australian Government&apos;s longest running and largest NGO program.</narrative>
